  "sequencing_notes": {
    "production_sequence": "Setup → Protect → Wash → Dry (24-48 hr) → Prep → Prime → Finish 1 → [Finish 2 QT3] → [Detail QT3] → Final Inspect → Cleanup",
    "edge_work": "No edge work in this spec. Siding terminates at vinyl J-channels and corner trim. Cut-in at trim junctions handled by MOD_VNRP_DETAIL (QT3 only).",
    "protection_sequence": "Landscape/hardscape protection → Window/door masking (spray) → Trim masking (spray) → Fixture masking → HVAC cover → Utility panel masking → Coating work → Protection teardown",
    "coat_sequence": "Adhesion primer (always, full coat) → Finish coat 1 → [Finish coat 2 QT3] → [J-channel detail QT3]",
    "elevation_strategy": "Work one elevation at a time. Follow shade to avoid coating hot PVC surfaces. Per-elevation access type allows mixed-height estimation.",
    "key_prohibitions": "NO spray-only on J-channels without brush detail (QT3). NO adhesion primer substitution. NO colors below LRV 35. NO alkyd/oil/hybrid binders. NO painting damaged vinyl panels."
  },

